{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_orianna": {
        "skill": "【附加包】球从它所在的位置飞到敌方英雄脚下并停留，造成<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>指令：杂音<>：球附近有敌人时自动放电，造成<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，<#ef5350ff>减速30%<>，队友<#7ee787ff>加速30%<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】球从它所在的位置飞向最危险的队友（自己更危险时回到身边），提供<#7ee787ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>45%护盾<>，路过的敌人受到<#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>。带球者+12护甲和魔抗。",
        "ult": "【附加包】待命<#ffb900ff>6秒<>，球附近有<#ffb900ff>2个<>敌方英雄、或能击杀其中1个时放出冲击波：造成<#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并把敌人<#ef5350ff>甩向球<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_orianna": {
        "skill": "【擴充包】球從它所在的位置飛到敵方英雄腳下並停留，造成<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。<#ff9028ff>指令：失衡<>：球附近有敵人時自動放電，造成<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，<#ef5350ff>緩速30%<>，隊友<#7ee787ff>加速30%<>。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】球從它所在的位置飛向最危險的隊友（自己更危險時回到身邊），提供<#7ee787ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>45%護盾<>，路過的敵人受到<#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>。帶球者+12護甲和魔抗。",
        "ult": "【擴充包】待命<#ffb900ff>6秒<>，球附近有<#ffb900ff>2個<>敵方英雄、或能擊殺其中1個時放出脈衝：造成<#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並把敵人<#ef5350ff>甩向球<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_orianna": {
        "skill": "[Add-on] The Ball flies from where it is to an enemy champion's feet and stays, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Command: Dissonance<>: with enemies near the Ball it pulses by itself for <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing enemies 30%<> and <#7ee787ff>hasting allies 30%<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] The Ball flies from where it is to the ally in the most danger (back to her when she is in more), shielding them for <#7ee787ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>45%<> and dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies on the way. Its holder gains 12 Armor and Magic Resist.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Waits up to <#ffb900ff>6s<> for <#ffb900ff>2<> enemy champions near the Ball, or one it would kill, then the Ball sends out a shockwave: <#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, enemies <#ef5350ff>flung toward the Ball<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_orianna": {
        "skill": "[확장] 공이 있는 곳에서 적 챔피언 발밑으로 날아가 남고 <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. <#ff9028ff>명령: 불협화음<>: 공 근처에 적이 있으면 저절로 <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, 적 <#ef5350ff>30% 둔화<>, 아군 <#7ee787ff>30% 가속<>.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 공이 있는 곳에서 가장 위험한 아군에게 날아가(자신이 더 위험하면 자신) <#7ee787ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>45% 보호막<>, 지나가는 적에게 <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. 공을 가진 자는 방어력·마법 저항력 +12.",
        "ult": "[확장] 최대 <#ffb900ff>6초<> 동안 공 근처에 적 챔피언 <#ffb900ff>2명<>이 있거나 1명을 처치할 수 있으면 충격파: <#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, 적을 공 쪽으로 <#ef5350ff>날려 보냅니다<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_orianna": {
        "skill": "【拡張】ボールが今ある場所から敵チャンピオンの足元へ飛んで残り、<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。<#ff9028ff>オーダー: 乱磁場<>：ボールの近くに敵がいると自動で放電し<#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、敵を<#ef5350ff>30%スロウ<>、味方は<#7ee787ff>30%加速<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】ボールが今ある場所から最も危険な味方へ飛び（自分の方が危険なら自分）、<#7ee787ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>45%のシールド<>、通り道の敵に<#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。持ち主は物理・魔法防御+12。",
        "ult": "【拡張】最大<#ffb900ff>6秒<>待機し、ボールの近くに敵チャンピオン<#ffb900ff>2体<>か倒せる敵がいれば衝撃波：<#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、敵をボールへ<#ef5350ff>引き寄せる<>。"
      }
    }
  }
}
